      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I hear you, and it's tough to feel like you're invisible. But remember, even if the world feels like it's turned its back on you, you still have the power to change your story. Starting fresh doesn't have to be a performance; it's about finding your true self and the people who appreciate it. You don't have to go through this alone, and there are always new opportunities out there. Just keep looking, and you'll find your place again.",
