      "content": "I understand how you feel, but it's important to remember that you are still here, still alive. Even if you feel like you're just a hollow shell, there's still a part of you that can find joy and purpose. It's okay to feel like you're waiting for your life to catch up, but don't give up on yourself. You don't have to prove your existence to anyone, but you can still find meaning in your own life. It's worth trying to find a place where you belong, even if it feels like you're starting from scratch. You never know what might happen when you open yourself up to new possibilities.",
